Open Threads
- Exact legal entity structure beyond "Ethena Labs Ltd. (BVI)" — whether there are additional operating entities (e.g., Cayman, Singapore) not publicly confirmed
- Full core team headcount and whether "core contributors" list on website is exhaustive or partial
- Testnet launch specifics: whether a public testnet preceded the private beta in Jan 2024, or if the private beta was the first external access
- ENA token contract deployments on non-EVM chains (Solana via Wormhole — is it a native SPL token or wrapped?)
- Official governance forum URL (governance.ethena.fi vs snapshot.org/space/ethena.eth) — which is canonical
- Whether "Internet Bond" is a distinct product brand or marketing term for sUSDe yield — docs use both interchangeably
- Complete list of Series A investors beyond the 7 named in The Block article — potential additional strategic angels not disclosed
- Auditor rotation policy and whether OpenZeppelin/Zellic/Spearbit are ongoing or one-time engagements
- Market maker exclusivity arrangements with Wintermute/GSR — whether formal agreements exist or ad-hoc
- Custody provider coverage for institutional mint/redeem (Copper/Fireblocks) — whether additional custodians (Anchorage, BitGo) are integrated
- Chainlink oracle dependency specifics: which price feeds (ETH/USD, funding rates, stETH/ETH) and fallback mechanisms
- DeFi integration revenue sharing or incentive arrangements with Pendle, Morpho, Aave, Curve, Equilibria, Ethereal, Spectra
- Regulatory status of USDe in major jurisdictions (US, EU, UK, Singapore) — no public legal opinion disclosed
- ENA token unlock schedule for team/investors — only high-level "4 years vesting" disclosed, no monthly cliff data
- Insurance fund or backstop mechanism for negative funding rate scenarios — protocol relies on insurance fund but size/management not transparent
- Cross-chain messaging risk: LayerZero DVN configuration for Ethena OFT, Wormhole guardian set for Solana deployment